<title>UK: Trinkaus &amp; Burkhardt set 100 mln mark step-up bond.</title>
<headline>Trinkaus &amp; Burkhardt set 100 mln mark step-up bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-09-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond was announced by lead manager Trinkaus &amp; Burkhardt.</p>
<p> BORROWER   TRINKAUS &amp; BURKHARDT</p>
<p> AMT    100 MLN DEM   COUPON     *4.0	MATURITY  **30.DEC.99</p>
<p> TYPE	 STEP-UP   ISS PRICE  100.0     PAY DATE  S-18.SEP.96</p>
<p> LISTING    DDF	 DENOMS (K) ONE	 GOV LAW     GERMAN</p>
<p> NOTES     *TO DECEMBER 1996 THEN 5.0 PCT THEREAFTER</p>
<p>	    **CALL AT PAR 30.DEC.96</p>
<p>	   S-SHORT FIRST COUPON</p>
<p>	     IHS SERIES 58</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
